#: ../../resources/usage.md:39
msgid ""
"**Layout & Display** 从外到内依次有算法、页面、单来源、图像单元和放大区五层网格。**Gaps (X,Y for each level)** "
"中每两个数字分别控制一层的水平、垂直间距，顺序是 Algorithms、Page、Per source、Image unit、Magnifiers。要拉开两种算法的拼接图，改第一对。显示比例 "
"**Display scale** 与保存比例分别设置；处理大图时可先缩小预览。勾选 **Fit window to image** 后刷新，可按画布调整窗口。"
msgstr ""
"**Layout & Display** has five nested grids, from outside in: Algorithms, Page, Per source, Image "
"unit, and Magnifiers. Each pair in **Gaps (X,Y for each level)** sets horizontal and vertical "
"spacing for one grid in that order. Change the first pair to separate algorithm panels. **Display"
" scale** is independent of export scale, so you can reduce the preview size for large images. "
"Enable **Fit window to image** and refresh to fit the canvas."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:41
msgid "放大同一区域、比较算法"
msgstr "Magnify matching regions and compare algorithms"

#: ../../resources/usage.md:43
msgid ""
"复现下图：取消 **Video mode**，用 **Parallel auto** 打开仓库的 `docs/media/example-images`。其中两个子目录各有一张 200 × "
"200 图片。在线阅读时也可下载 {download}`来源 01 <../media/example-images/01/00.png>` 和 {download}`来源 02 "
"<../media/example-images/02/00.png>`，分别存为 `example-images/01/00.png` 与 `example-"
"images/02/00.png`。将 **Page** 设为 `1,2`、**Image unit** 设为 `3,1`、**Display scale** 设为 `1,1`，勾选 "
"**Image**、**Title** 和 **Fit window to image**，保留 **Auto title**，按 **Ctrl+R**。两项的标题分别为来源目录名 01 和 "
"02。"
msgstr ""
"To reproduce the example, clear **Video mode** and use **Parallel auto** to open `docs/media"
"/example-images`. Each subfolder contains one 200 × 200 image. Online readers can download "
"{download}`source 01 <../media/example-images/01/00.png>` and {download}`source 02 <../media"
"/example-images/02/00.png>` and save them as `example-images/01/00.png` and `example-"
"images/02/00.png`. Set **Page** to `1,2`, **Image unit** to `3,1`, and **Display scale** to "
"`1,1`. Enable **Image**, **Title**, and **Fit window to image**, keep **Auto title** enabled, and"
" press **Ctrl+R**. The titles show the source folders, 01 and 02."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:45
msgid ""
"勾选 **Layout & Display → Magnifier**，按 "
"**Ctrl+R**。打开放大工具，在一张图上拖出矩形框。开启图像和放大图显示，即可在其他来源对照同一区域。**Magnifier & Boxes** 可设置框的位置、线宽及框线是否显示。"
msgstr ""
"Enable **Layout & Display → Magnifier** and press **Ctrl+R**. Activate the magnifier tool and "
"drag a rectangle on one image. Show both the image and magnifier to compare the same region "
"across sources. **Magnifier & Boxes** controls placement, line width, and outline visibility."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:46
msgid ""
"要微调，勾选 **Magnifier & Boxes → Select individual box**，单击已有框后用方向键移动。第二栏状态信息显示当前框编号和框数；按 Delete "
"删除选中的框。结束后退出选框模式再画新框。"
msgstr ""
"To fine-tune a box, enable **Magnifier & Boxes → Select individual box**, click it, and use the "
"arrow keys. The second status field shows the selected box number and total. Press Delete to "
"remove it. Leave box-selection mode before drawing another box."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:47
msgid ""
"在 **Custom Functions** 选择 **Image Darkening**，勾 **Selected**，保留 **Show original panel**。把 "
"**Algorithms** 设为 `2,1` 后刷新，原图和处理结果上下对照。选择 **All algorithms** 可同时比较多个算法；网格容量决定能显示多少面板，空位使用间隙颜色。"
msgstr ""
"Under **Custom Functions**, choose **Image Darkening**, enable **Selected**, and keep **Show "
"original panel** enabled. Set **Algorithms** to `2,1` and refresh to stack the original above its"
" result. **All algorithms** compares multiple algorithms. Grid capacity determines how many "
"panels appear, and empty cells use the gap colour."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:49
msgid "![同一输入从原图到双来源放大，再到原图与算法结果对照](../media/inspect-details.gif)"
msgstr ""
"![Original inputs, magnified details across sources, and an algorithm comparison](../media"
"/inspect-details.gif)"

#: ../../resources/usage.md:49
msgid "同一输入从原图到双来源放大，再到原图与算法结果对照"
msgstr "Original inputs, magnified details across sources, and an algorithm comparison"

#: ../../resources/usage.md:51
msgid ""
"在 **Titles** 关闭 **Auto title** 后，可组合父目录、文件名、前后缀等字段。颜色在 **Colour & Transparency** "
"中设置。要改一张图的标题，填写重命名文本，在目标图的右键菜单注入文本，再勾选 **Rename**。"
msgstr ""
"Clear **Auto title** in **Titles** to combine the parent folder, name, prefix, and suffix. Set "
"colours in **Colour & Transparency**. To change one image title, enter the replacement text, "
"inject it from the target image’s context menu, and enable **Rename**."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:53
msgid "找到某一张图"
msgstr "Find a particular image"

#: ../../resources/usage.md:55
msgid ""
"单击图像可在状态栏查看当前项、来源路径和视频时间。打开 **Index table**，用 **Visual items** 按画面上的位置查找，**Pages** 查页，**Sources**"
" 查原始来源。可由主窗口选中项定位到表格，也可双击表格行跳回对应页。路径详情支持复制；尚未拆出的帧可先有预期路径，等缓存就绪后文件才存在。需要离线核对时，可导出当前视图的 Excel 表格。"
msgstr ""
"Click an image to see its position, source path, and video time in the status bar. Open **Index "
"table** and choose **Visual items** to search by on-screen position, **Pages** for pages, or "
"**Sources** for originals. Locate the main window’s selection in the table, or double-click a row"
" to jump back to its page. You can copy path details. A frame’s expected path may appear before "
"extraction creates the file. Export the current view to Excel for offline inspection."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:57
msgid "播放卡顿时看什么"
msgstr "Diagnose slow playback"

#: ../../resources/usage.md:59
msgid ""
"把鼠标放在 **Performance & Cache → Power mode** 上，对比实际播放 FPS 与供给 "
"FPS（后台产出可显示页面的速度）。每秒显示一页可以同时更新多路视频，不能把页率乘以来源数当作单路帧率。"
msgstr ""
"Hover over **Performance & Cache → Power mode** and compare playback FPS with supply FPS "
"(finished pages produced per second). Several videos can advance on one page. Multiplying the "
"page rate by the number of sources would overstate the frame rate of an individual video."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "现象"
msgstr "Symptom"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "可先调整"
msgstr "What to check"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "播放均匀，但比预期慢"
msgstr "Playback is steady but slower than expected"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "查看 **Interval (s)**。手动设定是切换间隔的下限，例如 1 秒最多约每秒翻一页；需要更快时先减小它"
msgstr ""
"Check **Interval (s)**, the minimum time between pages. One second limits playback to about one "
"page per second. Lower it for faster playback."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "跳转后首屏慢，随后恢复"
msgstr "The first page is slow after a seek, then playback recovers"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "跳到长视频深处需要寻帧并准备当前页；先用较小预览比例，比较各来源的分辨率和编码"
msgstr ""
"A deep seek requires locating frames and preparing the current page. Try a smaller preview and "
"compare source resolutions and codecs."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "供给持续跟不上"
msgstr "Supply consistently lags behind playback"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "从 Balanced 切到 Performance 或 Maximum；如果仍受限，减小预览尺寸、可见算法数或每页图像数"
msgstr ""
"Switch from Balanced to Performance or Maximum. If supply still lags, reduce the preview size, "
"visible algorithm count, or items per page."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "大体流畅，偶尔等下一页"
msgstr "Mostly smooth, with occasional waits for the next page"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "**Cache frames** 控制近区，乘以 **Cache multiplier** 得到外层范围。适当增大可利用空闲资源提前准备，代价是更多磁盘读写和空间"
msgstr ""
"**Cache frames** sets the inner radius. Multiply it by **Cache multiplier** for the outer radius."
" A larger window can use idle capacity to prefetch more pages at the cost of disk space and I/O."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:68
msgid "Eco、Balanced、Performance、Maximum 提供不同的 CPU 和内存预算。持续速度还取决于解码、算法、拼接和磁盘。缓存会随浏览位置更新；需要长期保留的结果请导出。"
msgstr ""
"Eco, Balanced, Performance, and Maximum offer different CPU and memory budgets. Sustained speed "
"also depends on decoding, algorithms, stitching, and disk I/O. The cache follows your browsing "
"position. Export any results you want to keep."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:70
msgid "挑图和导出"
msgstr "Select and export images"

#: ../../resources/usage.md:72
msgid "在 **Save Settings** 选择输出目录、输出模式、格式和比例。点击工具栏保存图标或 **Ctrl+S** 后，后台按点击时的设置生成文件，右侧状态栏显示进度。"
msgstr ""
"In **Save Settings**, choose the output folder, content, format, and scale. Click the toolbar "
"Save icon or press **Ctrl+S**. The background export uses the settings at the time of the click, "
"with progress shown on the right of the status bar."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "输出选项"
msgstr "Output option"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "得到什么"
msgstr "What is saved"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "Stitch"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "最终画面在 `composed`，各算法的拼接图在 `algorithms/<算法>/stitch_images`"
msgstr ""
"The final page in `composed` and each algorithm’s stitched panel in "
"`algorithms/<algorithm>/stitch_images`."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "Selected images"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "选择结果在各算法的 `select_images` 中，按来源归档"
msgstr "Selected images in each algorithm’s `select_images` folder, grouped by source."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "Magnifiers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "输出放大区域和带框图。组合模式下，没有框会跳过这一项，其他已选输出照常保存"
msgstr ""
"Magnified regions and images with boxes. With combined output and no boxes, the other requested "
"outputs are still saved."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:80
msgid ""
"**挑选规则。** 单击确定位置，再保存 **Selected images**；右键 **Select image** 是该操作的快捷方式。Parallel auto/manual "
"会从各来源选同一位置，在 Multiple frames per source 下会保留点中的来源内偏移。Sequential、File List 和 Play sources "
"sequentially 只挑当前项；显示算法时也可输出相应处理结果。图像模式的移动选项会移动源文件，首次尝试建议使用副本；视频模式不会移动源视频。"
msgstr ""
"**Selection rules.** Click a position and save **Selected images**, or use **Select image** in "
"the context menu. Parallel auto/manual selects the corresponding position from every source, "
"retaining the clicked offset with Multiple frames per source. Sequential, File List, and Play "
"sources sequentially select the current item only. Visible algorithm results can also be "
"exported. Move files moves original image files, so try it on copies first. Source videos stay in"
" place."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:82
msgid ""
"**画质。** JPG 可调质量，采用 4:4:4 色度采样；PNG 的压缩级别影响耗时和文件大小；PDF 可选 Lossless 或 Compact (JPG)。保留视频解码所得细节时，选择 "
"PNG 缓存、输出比例 `1,1`，导出 PNG 或 Lossless PDF。这样可以避免额外的 JPG 编码；视频源本身的压缩损失仍存在。缓存选 **auto** 时，PNG/PDF "
"且两个输出比例均至少为 1 会用 PNG，否则用 JPG。修改缓存格式后手动刷新。"
msgstr ""
"**Quality.** JPG offers adjustable quality with 4:4:4 chroma sampling. PNG compression changes "
"encoding time and file size. PDF offers Lossless or Compact (JPG). To retain decoded video "
"detail, use PNG caching, output scale `1,1`, and PNG or Lossless PDF export. This avoids "
"additional JPEG encoding. Compression losses already present in the video remain. With `auto` "
"caching, PNG/PDF export uses PNG when both output scale factors are at least 1. Other "
"combinations use JPG. Refresh after changing the cache format."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:84
msgid ""
"**批量保存。** 勾选 **Save all pages**后点击保存，**Esc** 暂停，重新点击保存继续。如果改变了保存参数，再次保存会从头开始。在 **Configuration** "
"中 **Save / Load** 可保存、取回一套配置；**Reset** 恢复默认设置。正常关闭窗口会记住最后使用的参数。"
msgstr ""
"**Batch saving.** Enable **Save all pages** and click Save. Press **Esc** to pause and click Save"
" again to resume. Changing export settings restarts the batch. **Configuration → Save / Load** "
"stores and retrieves a settings snapshot. **Reset** restores defaults. Closing the window "
"normally preserves the last-used settings."

